    ],
    "text": "NOTICE UNDER SECTION",
    "fonts": [
      "CIDFont+F3"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.96037483215332
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.76,
      422.89,
      299.06,
      525.59
    ],
    "text": "My Referance No.: 4/1/5/29 Reference No. of the Ministry of Lands and Parlimentery Reforms: 4-3/9/2015/WS/332 I hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of the Section 7 of Land Acquisition Act, that the Government intends to acquire the following land, which is required for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "CIDFont+F1",
      "CIDFont+F3",
      "CIDFont+F5"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.96037483215332
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.76,
      526.09,
      286.46,
      675.11
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land to be acquired: The alloment of Land called \u201c Kumbalkotuwe watta\u201d in total extent of about 0.0354 Hecteres, depicted as Lot No. 153 in Cadastral Map No. 420371 Bolck No. 01 Sheet No. 04, dated on 10.11.2017, Surveyed and Prepared by the Surveyor General, Situated at the Village of Gangoda, Ward No. 1 ( Within the Municipal Council Limits, Kurunegala), in Gangoda Grama Niladhari Division of No. 832, in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Kurunegala in Kurunegala District, North Western Province and bounded as Follows.",
    "fonts": [
      "CIDFont+F1",
      "CIDFont+F5"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.96037483215332
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      303.96,
      345.61,
      541.92,
      459.83
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 153 Name of the Land: Kumbalkotuwe Watta; Extent of the Land: 0.0354 Hectares Boundaries North: Ananda Hamangoda Mawatha and Kumbalkotuwe Watta and Lot No. 154, East: Lot No. 154 and Lot No. 148; Southt: No. 148 and 152; West: Lot No. 152 and Ananda Hamangoda Mawatha; Name and Address of the Claimant: Sunree Advertising Services Private Limited, No.301, Puttalam Road, Kurunegala; Extent: 0.0354 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "CIDFont+F1",
      "CIDFont+F3"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.96037483215332
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      303.96,
      462.59,
      544.46,
      601.91
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at the Divisional Secretary\u2019s office, at Kurunegala on the 26th day of February 2018 at 10.30 a.m. and are hereby required to notify to me in writing ( in duplicate) on or before the 19 th day of February 2018, the nature of their interests in the Land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said Land, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount. .",
    "fonts": [
      "CIDFont+F1"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.480247497558594,
      9.96037483215332
    ]
  },
